==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|sco|fankle}}, a variant of {{der|en|en|fangle}} (as {{cog|sco|fank}} is for {{cog|en|fang}}). {{doublet|en|fangle}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈfæŋkəl/}}
* {{rhymes|en|æŋkəl}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|ambitransitive}} To [[tangle]] or [[entangle]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A tangled condition.
